'''Builds''' collects the current meta and community builds for [[Viscous]]. Each build has its own page with an item build order, ability leveling order, and playstyle notes.

== Browse builds ==
<deadlockbuildindex category="Builds" />

== Adding a build ==
Create a new page named after the build, then paste the [[Template:Build|Build template]] at the top and fill in the sections. See [[Template:Build]] for the field reference. Every page using the template is listed here automatically.

